    <statement><p>Calculate the 3x3 determinant:</p>
<p><m>\left| \begin{array}{ccc}
-3 \amp  -6 \amp  -4 \\
7 \amp  -8 \amp  3 \\
-4 \amp  -4 \amp  7  \end{array} \right| =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>738</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>\left| \begin{array}{ccc}
-3 \amp  -6 \amp  -4 \\
7 \amp  -8 \amp  3 \\
-4 \amp  -4 \amp  7  \end{array} \right| = -3 \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 -8 \amp  3 \\
 -4 \amp  7  \end{array} \right|  + 6  \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 7 \amp  3 \\
 -4 \amp  7  \end{array} \right|  - 4  \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 7 \amp  -8 \\
 -4 \amp  -4  \end{array} \right| =</m>



<m>= -3(-8\cdot 7-3\cdot -4) + 6(7\cdot 7-3\cdot -4) - 4(7\cdot -4 + 8\cdot -4)=738</m>






</solution>
